Design provenance
-----------------
The dual-graph model, the planner/worker/guard split, and several prompt rules are
adapted from ARTEX (AGPL-3.0). The implementation in titan/ is an independent Python
rewrite with a different persistence layer, guard, and runtime; no Go source is
compiled or vendored here.

Titan is a testing tool. It is intended only for systems for which the operator holds
written authorization. The authors accept no liability for unauthorized use.
